OL,5,G0825 Prue Leith's Cotswold Kitchen
OL,6,     FPrue is joined by TV and radio
OL,7,     Fpresenter Fearne Cotton, who makes
OL,8,     Fher favourite carrot cake with
OL,9,     Fblueberry icing mousse and
OL,10,     Fexplains how painting and baking
OL,11,     Fare her escape from the stresses
OL,12,     Fof everyday life. Prue and her
OL,13,     Fhusband John turn back the clock
OL,14,     Fto the 1970s and make a prawn
OL,15,     Fcocktail sharing platter, while he
OL,16,     Fhas the tricky task of fanning an
OL,17,     Favocado and carving radish
OL,18,     Frosettes
