OL,5,G1615 UEFA Nations League Live
OL,6,     FCroatia v England (Kick-off
OL,7,     F5.00pm). Mark Pougatch presents
OL,8,     Fall the action from the third
OL,9,     FGroup A3 match for both teams,
OL,10,     Fheld at Stadion HNK Rijeka.
OL,11,     FCroatia famously knocked England
OL,12,     Fout of the 2018 FIFA World Cup at
OL,13,     Fthe semi-final stage, but the
OL,14,     FThree Lions have won three and
OL,15,     Fdrawn one of the four meetings
OL,16,     Fbetween the sides since then. The
OL,17,     Fmost recent of those contests came
OL,18,     Fin the group stage of this
OL,19,     Fsummer's World Cup, when England
OL,20,     Fwon an entertaining game 4-2
OL,21,     Fthanks to a brace by Harry Kane
OL,22,     Fand further strikes from Jude
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG5/13
