OL,5,G0300 Dermot's Taste of Ireland
OL,6,     FDermot O'Leary travels to
OL,7,     FLetterkenny in Co Donegal,
OL,8,     Fdiscovering a place full of
OL,9,     Funforgettable people, stories and
OL,10,     Ffood. He forages for golden
OL,11,     Fmushrooms in an ancient rainforest
OL,12,     Fbefore learning to make tortellini
OL,13,     Fcompletely from scratch. Dermot
OL,14,     Falso meets a Syrian
OL,15,     Frefugee-turned-honey farmer who
OL,16,     Fteaches him how to extract honey
OL,17,     Ffrom the hive and shares
OL,18,     Ftraditions from home, including
OL,19,     Fhow to enjoy honey with strong
OL,20,     Fcoffee and a sweet dish called
OL,21,     Fknaffe
OL,23,VpppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG11/13
